{"seq":3,"slug":"pinia-vue-state","title":"Pinia Vue 状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/state-management-patterns/cross-framework/pinia-vue-state","wordCount":311,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"pinia-vue-状态管理\">Pinia Vue 状态管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Pinia 是 Vue 官方推荐的状态管理库，替代了 Vuex，提供了更简单的 API 和更好的 TypeScript 支持。Pinia 的设计理念是去除 Vuex 中饱受诟病的 mutations 层，让状态修改更直接、更符合 Composition API 的使用习惯。它同时支持 Options API 和 Setup 函数两种定义风格，与 Vue DevTools 深度集成。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Pinia Store] --&gt; B[State]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Getters]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Actions]&#10;    B --&gt; E[响应式数据源]&#10;    C --&gt; F[派生计算值]&#10;    D --&gt; G[同步/异步操作]&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    E --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[Pinia Store] --&gt; B[State]\n    A --&gt; C[Getters]\n    A --&gt; D[Actions]\n    B --&gt; E[响应式数据源]\n    C --&gt; F[派生计算值]\n    D --&gt; G[同步/异步操作]\n    G --&gt; B\n    E --&gt; C</pre><h3 id=\"pinia-vs-vuex\">Pinia vs Vuex</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Pinia</th>\n<th>Vuex</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API</td>\n<td>更简单</td>\n<td>较复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mutations</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DevTools</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块系统</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSR 支持</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>需要配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码拆分</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>需手动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基础用法\">基础用法</h2><h3 id=\"创建-store\">创建 Store</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { defineStore } from &#39;pinia&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const useCounterStore = defineStore(&#39;counter&#39;, {&#10;  state: () =&gt; ({&#10;    count: 0,&#10;  }),&#10;  getters: {&#10;    doubleCount: (state) =&gt; state.count * 2,&#10;    doubleCountPlusOne(): number {&#10;      return this.doubleCount + 1;&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  actions: {&#10;    increment() {&#10;      this.count++;&#10;    },&#10;    decrement() {&#10;      this.count--;&#10;    },&#10;    reset() {&#10;      this.count = 0;&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineStore } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pinia'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> useCounterStore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'counter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  getters: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span